[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m2/6  The Actor's 402: three ways to pay\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mApify's own upto and exact, plus 4mica-credit: a collateral-backed guarantee, signed from the 402 alone.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.021, "o", "  upto           0.01 USDC cap   window 18000s\r\n  exact          0.01 USDC cap   window 60s\r\n  4mica-credit   0.01 USDC cap   window 18000s   ← paid with this\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m3/6  Connect through mcpc, Apify's CLI\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mThe fork signs 4mica-credit only when asked for it, and signs afresh on every call.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.432, "o", "  connected to 4mica-apify-demo   tools: run-actor   paying with 4mica-credit\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m4/6  First run\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mmcpc signs the cap. The seller verifies, runs, settles, then pays the unused part back as a guarantee.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
